; BODYPART.SCR
; Format: BODYPARTDEF <ID> <DAMAGE_CATEGORY> <WEIGHT> <NAME>
; Weights are relative hit probabilities, not percentages.

BODYPARTDEF 0 CORE 30 head
BODYPARTDEF 1 CORE 50 body
BODYPARTDEF 2 CORE 20 back
BODYPARTDEF 3 CORE 30 second head
BODYPARTDEF 4 CORE 50 thorax

BODYPARTDEF 5 LIMB 100 right arm
BODYPARTDEF 6 LIMB 100 left arm
BODYPARTDEF 7 LIMB 100 right leg
BODYPARTDEF 8 LIMB 100 left leg
BODYPARTDEF 9 LIMB 100 right hind leg
BODYPARTDEF 10 LIMB 100 left hind leg
BODYPARTDEF 11 LIMB 100 right foreleg
BODYPARTDEF 12 LIMB 100 left foreleg

BODYPARTDEF 13 HAND 70 right hand
BODYPARTDEF 14 HAND 70 left hand

; Additional locations
BODYPARTDEF 15 LIMB 100 right wing
BODYPARTDEF 16 LIMB 100 left wing
BODYPARTDEF 17 LIMB 80 tail
BODYPARTDEF 18 HAND 70 right paw
BODYPARTDEF 19 HAND 70 left paw
BODYPARTDEF 20 LIMB 100 tentacles
BODYPARTDEF 21 LIMB 80 fin
BODYPARTDEF 22 LIMB 80 pincer
BODYPARTDEF 23 CORE 40 underbelly
BODYPARTDEF 24 LIMB 100 hindquarter

BODYPARTDEF 25 HAND 70 right foot
BODYPARTDEF 26 HAND 70 left foot

; Standard anatomy definitions
; Format: BODYTYPEDEF <TYPE> <PART_ID> <PART_ID> ...

BODYTYPEDEF HUMAN 0 1 2 5 6 7 8 13 14 25 26
BODYTYPEDEF AVINE 0 1 2 15 16 7 8
BODYTYPEDEF ANIMAL 0 1 2 9 10 11 12 17